   ],
   "html": "<p>As part of Pixel's new series, “Canon Creator Events,” we took over the Santa Monica Pier for an invite-only evening that celebrated the hard work and creativity of 14 creators, while simultaneously connecting and inspiring the next generation of creators.</p>\n<p>Guests had exclusive access to all the carnival rides, games, and food within the park. Alongside billboard-sized odes to the creators, they had the chance to win exclusive and brand new Canon gear. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Creator & Video Wall",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Upon arrival, all guests were greeted by our Creator Wall which paid tribute to the highlighted creators of the evening and their work. It also served as a backdrop for photos and future content. Within the park we constructed a Video Wall to display motion content from these creators, enticing guests  to further share on socials. </p>"
    },
