  {
   "title": "PIER FUN & GAMES",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Big ticketprizes and brand new Canon products were available to win at select games around the pier. One of LA’s hottest up and coming DJs Suga Shay set the vibe for the evening while guests tested out every ride! </p>"
